554-### 16.3 Operational-evidence rule
555-
556-When the live question is not whether a packet exists but whether the underlying control loop is operational:
557-- distinguish a named packet from a linked run artifact with `scenario_id`, `run_id`, `cohort_id`, `trace_id`, or `artifact_version`
